      "prompt": "实现 `apply_mutations(records, mutations)`，用纯 Python 模拟一组按顺序执行的 DML 操作。初始记录和插入记录都包含唯一整数 `id`；变更有三种形式：`insert` 携带 `record`，`update` 携带 `id` 与 `changes`，`delete` 携带 `id`。\n\n`insert` 遇到已存在的 `id` 时忽略；`update` 和 `delete` 遇到不存在的 `id` 时忽略；更新中的 `id` 字段不可改变原主键。返回按 `id` 从小到大排列的新记录列表，不得修改传入的记录或变更对象。",
      "function_name": "apply_mutations",
      "signature": {
        "parameters": [
          {"name": "records", "type": "list[dict[str, object]]"},
          {"name": "mutations", "type": "list[dict[str, object]]"}
        ],
        "returns": "list[dict[str, object]]"
      },
      "starter_code": "def apply_mutations(records: list[dict], mutations: list[dict]) -> list[dict]:\n    return []\n",
      "hints": ["先用一个公开样例手算输入和预期输出，把题目拆成“输入、处理、返回”三步。", "先关注 `apply_mutations` 的参数和 sql, dml 相关概念；可以先写清楚每一步，再决定使用循环、条件或列表/字典操作。", "伪代码：读取每个输入 → 按题目条件处理 → 把结果放入新的列表或字典 → 返回结果；最后再检查空输入、重复值和边界情况。"],
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [
            [
              {"id": 1, "name": "Ada", "score": 80},
              {"id": 2, "name": "Lin", "score": 72}
            ],
            [
              {"op": "update", "id": 1, "changes": {"score": 92}},
              {"op": "delete", "id": 2},
              {"op": "insert", "record": {"id": 3, "name": "Bo", "score": 88}}
            ]
          ],
          "expected": [
            {"id": 1, "name": "Ada", "score": 92},
            {"id": 3, "name": "Bo", "score": 88}
          ],
          "explanation": "更新、删除和插入按照给定顺序依次生效。"
        },
        {
          "args": [
            [],
            [
              {"op": "insert", "record": {"id": 5, "name": "Eve"}},
              {"op": "insert", "record": {"id": 2, "name": "Chen"}}
            ]
          ],
          "expected": [
            {"id": 2, "name": "Chen"},
            {"id": 5, "name": "Eve"}
          ],
          "explanation": "返回结果始终按主键排序，而不是按插入顺序排序。"
        },
        {
          "args": [
            [{"id": 1, "name": "Old"}],
            [
              {"op": "insert", "record": {"id": 1, "name": "Duplicate"}},
              {"op": "update", "id": 9, "changes": {"name": "Missing"}},
              {"op": "delete", "id": 7},
              {"op": "update", "id": 1, "changes": {"id": 99, "name": "New"}}
            ]
          ],
          "expected": [{"id": 1, "name": "New"}],
          "explanation": "重复插入和未知主键操作被忽略，更新也不能改写主键。"
        }
      ]
    },
